                                                    <li>空间不足时翻转到另一侧，并贴住视口边缘</li>
                                                    <li>Modal 时提供遮罩、焦点陷阱与背景滚动锁</li>
                                                </ul>
                                                <div class="preview-overlay-demo__popover-actions">
                                                    <Button Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Primary" OnClick="PreviewPopoverAction">了解更多</Button>
                                                    <Button Size="Size.Small" Variant="ButtonVariant.Ghost" OnClick="ClosePopoverPreview">关闭浮层</Button>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </ChildContent>
                                    </Popover>
                                </PopupHost>
                                <p class="preview-overlay-demo__hint" role="status">@_popoverNote</p>
                            </div>
                        </Preview>
                        <Controls>
                            <div class="control-field">
                                <span>Placement</span>
                                <ShowcaseSelect TValue="PopupPlacement" Id="popover-placement" AriaLabel="Placement" Options="@(Enum.GetValues<PopupPlacement>())" @bind-Value="_popoverPlacement" />
                            </div>
                            <Checkbox Size="Size.Small" @bind-Value="_popoverModal">Modal</Checkbox>
                            <Checkbox Size="Size.Small" @bind-Value="_popoverCloseOnOverlayClick">CloseOnOverlayClick</Checkbox>
                        </Controls>
                        <Notes>
                            <span>浮层定位在 <code>PopupHost</code>（<code>position: relative</code>）内，空间不足时翻到另一侧并把内容贴回视口；<code>Placement</code> 提供四个起始方位。</span>
                            <span><code>Escape</code>、点击外部、<code>Modal</code> 遮罩都会通过 <code>OpenChanged</code> 请求关闭，<code>Open</code> 始终由使用方持有。</span>
                            <span><code>Modal</code> 额外提供遮罩、<code>aria-modal</code>、焦点陷阱（Tab 循环、关闭后焦点回到触发点）和背景滚动锁。</span>
                        </Notes>
                    </ComponentPreview>
                    break;

                case "tooltip":
                    <ComponentPreview AnchorId="tooltip" Category="通知组件" Title="Tooltip" ComponentName="Tooltip" Description="通过悬停或键盘焦点显示辅助说明，并在视口边缘自动翻转与偏移。" Parameters="@TooltipParameters">
                        <Preview>
                            <div class="preview-overlay-demo">
                                <p class="preview-overlay-demo__hint">将鼠标悬停在按钮上，或使用 Tab 聚焦按钮，查看 Tooltip 内容：</p>
                                <Tooltip Text="这是 Tooltip 的完整说明文字，用于补充按钮的用途和操作提示。" Placement="@_tooltipPlacement">
                                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline">悬停或聚焦查看说明</Button>
                                </Tooltip>
                                <div class="preview-state-row" aria-label="四个方位的 Tooltip 对照">
                                    @foreach (var placement in Enum.GetValues<TooltipPlacement>())
                                    {
                                        var placementLabel = $"Placement = {placement}";
                                        <Tooltip Text="@placementLabel" Placement="@placement">
                                            <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Ghost" Size="Size.Small">@placement</Button>
                                        </Tooltip>
                                    }
                                </div>
                                <p class="preview-overlay-demo__hint">Tooltip 内容：这是 Tooltip 的完整说明文字，用于补充按钮的用途和操作提示。</p>
                            </div>
                        </Preview>
                        <Controls>
                            <div class="control-field">
                                <span>Placement</span>
                                <ShowcaseSelect TValue="TooltipPlacement" Id="tooltip-placement" AriaLabel="Placement" Options="@(Enum.GetValues<TooltipPlacement>())" @bind-Value="_tooltipPlacement" />
                            </div>
                        </Controls>
                        <Notes>
                            <span>提示文本会作为 <code>ChildContent</code> 中第一个可聚焦元素的 <code>aria-describedby</code>，屏幕阅读器可直接朗读。</span>
                            <span>方位会随视口空间自动翻转并沿交叉轴偏移；把触发元素放在靠近视口边缘的位置即可观察该行为。</span>
                        </Notes>
                    </ComponentPreview>
                    break;

                case "feedback":
                    <ComponentPreview AnchorId="feedback"
                                      Category="通知组件"
                                      Title="Dialog、Alert、Confirm、Toast"
                                      ComponentName="DialogProvider + IDialogService"
                                      Description="通过同一个 DialogProvider 展示模态对话框、非模态 Alert 和非阻塞 Toast。"
                                      Parameters="@FeedbackParameters"
                                      Events="@FeedbackEvents"
                                      Contracts="@FeedbackContracts">
                        <Preview>
                            <div class="preview-stack preview-feedback-actions">
                                <div class="preview-action-row">
                                    <Button Color="@FeedbackColor" OnClick="ShowPreviewAlert">Alert</Button>
                                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Color="@FeedbackColor" OnClick="ShowPreviewConfirm">Confirm</Button>
                                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Ghost" Color="@FeedbackColor" OnClick="ShowPreviewToast">Toast</Button>
                                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Text" Color="@FeedbackColor" OnClick="ShowPreviewAlertAndToast">Alert + Toast</Button>
                                </div>
                                <span class="preview-feedback" role="status">@_feedbackNote</span>
                            </div>
                        </Preview>
                        <Controls>
                            <div class="control-field">
                                <span>Severity</span>
                                <ShowcaseSelect TValue="Severity" Id="feedback-severity" AriaLabel="Severity" Options="@FeedbackSeverityOptions" TextSelector="@FeedbackSeverityText" @bind-Value="_feedbackSeverity" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="control-field">
                                <span>ToastPosition</span>
                                <ShowcaseSelect TValue="ToastPosition" Id="feedback-position" AriaLabel="ToastPosition" Options="@(Enum.GetValues<ToastPosition>())" @bind-Value="_feedbackPosition" />
                            </div>
                        </Controls>
                        <Notes>
                            <span>Alert 和 Toast 使用 <code>Duration</code> 控制自动关闭；设置为 <code>TimeSpan.Zero</code> 时保持持久显示。</span>
                            <span><code>Alert + Toast</code> 会在同一 <code>ToastPosition</code> 同时发送两类通知，用于对照它们在同一个位置容器内的堆叠顺序。</span>
                        </Notes>
                    </ComponentPreview>
                    break;
                }
            </div>
        </main>
